[statement]
A package whose condition is `!` entries alone is not installed where no
package its condition names is installed: `q` states `!y`, and `y`, which
`p2` would need, is never installed, since `v` takes `p1`; apk does not
install `q`. Contrast
`install-order/install-if-a-negated-entry-the-package-placed-escapes-triggers`,
where a package of the name is installed at a version the entry does not
forbid.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v

P:p1
V:1
p:v
k:20

P:p2
V:1
p:v
k:10
D:y

P:y
V:1

P:q
V:1
i:!y

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p1 1
install app 1
